Compliance notes for this integration
-------------------------------------

  * The gateway is an **unofficial** front end. It uses a WorkBuddy account as
    its upstream and is intended for your own authorised account(s), on your
    own machine or private environment only.

  * `auths/` holds plaintext tokens. Treat that directory as a secret. It is
    created under `~/.workbuddy2dsh/auths` by default and is never written into
    this repository.

  * The gateway binds to `127.0.0.1` only. Do not expose it publicly: the API
    key is a single shared secret with no per-user scoping.

